      "message": "There is actually a problem: when I change the ec_rate for the accelerometers only, the gyroscope, when setting the ODR to 0 in S3, will re-enable the interrupt, since it is not in forced mode:\n\nSee the EC debug (ignore the UNCHANGED, see b:331948354):\n```\n24-03-29 17:45:09.656 [583.181543 Lid Accel ODR: 10000 INT: OFF - roundup 1 from config 2 [AP 0]: 0]\n24-03-29 17:45:09.666 [583.184237 Base Accel ODR: 10000 INT: UNCHANGED - roundup 1 from config 2 [AP 0]: 0]\n24-03-29 17:45:09.679 [583.187915 Base Gyro ODR: 0 INT: ON - roundup 1 from config 0 [AP 0]: 0]\n```\n\nWe need to allow forced mode when ODR is 0.",
      "revId": "869d6d3c362262274d9f5c43e877bb5b5a841664",
